# ontology-atlas
#
# With the permanent removal of the auth + cloud sync surface in R10 (2026-05),
# the dependency on environment variables itself disappeared. Both `pnpm dev` and `pnpm build`
# work without a separate .env.
#
# If the user points to a markdown folder (File System Access API), vault mode is entered.
# Unselected folder state falls back to the build-time dogfood manifest (`docs/ontology/`).
#
# Optional hosted-download release switch — opt-in (W-3 2026-07-21: the
# internal release checklist + CI copy command are owner/contributor-only,
# so /download hides them unless explicitly turned on):
# - 1: show the first-public-DMG checklist on /download (owner review window)
# - unset / 0: hide that checklist (default — end-user page)
NEXT_PUBLIC_OATLAS_FIRST_RELEASE_PENDING=1
#
# Register new keys in this file when future cloud collab stages are reintroduced.
